SMP was unbundled.  If you bought the option, then you would
receive another magtape with the file CPNSER.MAC (and its REL).

That was all you needed to link into your monitor (with the 
appropriate MONGEN questions answered) to have the software
functionality.  You could run this even with one CPU up.
The monitor would just assume that those devices had been
taken off-line.

/BAH


