As far as I know the VAX 11/782 was two VAX 11/780 (each with their own 
memory subsystem) connected together with a shared memory buffer.  It 
was more of a "cluster" than a true SMP (ie each 11/780 could not see 
all of the other 11/780's memory...just what was in the shared buffer).

